{"title":"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_19\">Problem 19</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 19\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> is the midpoint of side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/a/9aafc7e3cc1eafce5e16d3a45250eeda7b1a6526.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AN$\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" /> bisects <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/6/5862947b38a495ec9be80e5b9c7582de6cf0d269.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/b/a2b62a431d3b2017a247078b769b6e4669ec092c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BN\\perp AN$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is the measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/6/5862947b38a495ec9be80e5b9c7582de6cf0d269.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" />. If sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> have lengths <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, respectively, then find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/c/bbcfabd65745f2b759dea1840f9a0753b2f992e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MN$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/b/6cb097db5b819835c85a74fa407ed436505282c2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(200); defaultpen(linewidth(0.7)+fontsize(10)); pair B=origin, A=14*dir(42), C=intersectionpoint(B--(30,0), Circle(A,19)), M=midpoint(B--C), b=A+14*dir(A--C), N=foot(A, B, b); draw(N--B--A--N--M--C--A^^B--M); markscalefactor=0.1; draw(rightanglemark(B,N,A)); pair point=N; label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, dir(point--A)); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, dir(point--B)); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, dir(point--C)); label(&quot;$M$&quot;, M, S); label(&quot;$N$&quot;, N, dir(30)); label(rotate(angle(dir(A--C)))*&quot;$19$&quot;, A--C, dir(A--C)*dir(90)); label(rotate(angle(dir(A--B)))*&quot;$14$&quot;, A--B, dir(A--B)*dir(270)); [/asy]\" width=\"335\" height=\"142\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/e/d9e2a55b51f95600b45f5dffdf0277b62fbac7f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\dfrac{5}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{5}{2}-\\sin\\theta\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{5}{2}-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\sin\\theta\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\dfrac{5}{2}-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\theta\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"603\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/3/f03cdbd92cf5279661066299eab1aebab643bdaf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(200); defaultpen(linewidth(0.7)+fontsize(10)); pair B=origin, A=14*dir(42), C=intersectionpoint(B--(30,0), Circle(A,19)), M=midpoint(B--C), b=A+14*dir(A--C), N=foot(A, B, b), Q=2*N-B; draw(N--B--A--N--M--C--A^^B--M); draw(N--Q); markscalefactor=0.1; draw(rightanglemark(B,N,A)); markscalefactor=0.3; draw(anglemark(B,A,N)); markscalefactor=0.2; draw(anglemark(N,A,Q)); markscalefactor=0.1; pair point=N; label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, dir(point--A)); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, dir(point--B)); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, dir(point--C)); label(&quot;$M$&quot;, M, dir(-45)); label(&quot;$N$&quot;, N, dir(45)); label(&quot;$Q$&quot;, Q, dir(45));  label(rotate(angle(dir(A--Q)))*&quot;$14$&quot;, A--Q, dir(A--Q)*dir(90)); label(rotate(angle(dir(Q--C)))*&quot;$5$&quot;, Q--C, dir(Q--C)*dir(90)); label(rotate(angle(dir(A--B)))*&quot;$14$&quot;, A--B, dir(A--B)*dir(270)); [/asy]\" width=\"335\" height=\"138\" />\n</p><p>Extend <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/a/0fa81c0cbf8b517733059abb0faf839dd2a56300.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BN$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> to meet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/1/1c17a2eb09af0db227db5e2d4712355fa5e5fd8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ANB \\cong \\triangle ANQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"145\" height=\"17\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/b/e3b7f9924f81100b8405d5a67ed4363ff0bc89d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AQ=AB=14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"125\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/3/8d3fdb6d0fe42b1c63392f253c5175d09c638bc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CQ = 19-14=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"147\" height=\"18\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/9/f691e3b2f53ce7f45807798f152837e0bf6920a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$NB = NQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"88\" height=\"18\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/8/b18928339c213c3e404a0605cf86e27a33c8d970.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BQ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"29\" height=\"19\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/6/d369ebea3ffabd0100e6d422c27495490e625b02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BMN \\sim \\triangle BCQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"153\" height=\"18\" />, and therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/b/6cb051d8911b2865637a73d63ee82d809de90e16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MN = \\frac{1}{2}CQ = \\boxed{(\\textbf{B})\\ \\frac{5}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"186\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME\" title=\"1981 AHSME\">1981 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1981 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1981\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/